  <data name="HelpQuickstartRouting.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Routing matrix: Click any cell to route an audio input (Mic, Chat, Music, etc.) to the desired outputs.</value></data>
  <data name="HelpQuickstartMonitor.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Monitor (Mic Monitor): Direct, dry hardware sidetone for your voice in headphones without DSP reverb.</value></data>
  <data name="HelpQuickstartBleep.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Censor tone (!@#$?*): Reliably routed to Chat Mic, Broadcast stream, and your headphone monitor.</value></data>
